WEBVTT

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:35.090
We're gonna be late
if we don't hurry!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.190
Shaddup!
I know, already!

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:47.470
Nihao, Ranma!

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.610
Ranma happy
to see Shampoo?

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:55.150
Nok haffy ak all!

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:00.830
Ranma, I'm going ahead.
Please, take your time.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.120
Akane always such
a violent girl.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:04.420
W-Wait a second!

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.790
Ranma! Forget
that other woman!

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.060
That's not what I meant!
I'm gonna be late!

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:13.070
Ranma no go to school!
Take Shampoo to date!

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.940
You got to be kiddin'!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.910
Great-grandmother,
I home!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.380
Welcome back,
Shampoo.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.350
Jewelry so beautiful!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.790
I used to wear them
when I was a young girl.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.050
Pick any one you like.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.490
I so happy!

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.760
What a funny box.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.130
Is lock shut...

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:50.530
Brooch is so beautiful!

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:09.790
Ranma, just what do
you think of Shampoo?

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.360
"Think"? I don't
think anythin' of her.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:16.460
Is that so? She'll keep chasing
you until you tell her not to.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.230
Whad'm I supposed
to do when she decides...

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.970
Why now under
Shampoo's bike, Ranma?

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.440
Wait a...

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:32.880
If Ranma have no
business with Shampoo...

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.250
Then leave
Shampoo ALONE!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.960
A Midsummer's Greeting

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:45.220
Here's one...

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.690
"In the human world..."

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.230
"In the human world..."

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:59.810
"Pandas slave eternally,
A life of sorrow."

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.280
Ranma, did you do something
to make Shampoo angry?

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.050
Beats me.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:13.630
It's not normal for
Shampoo to act like that.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.150
She's been chasin'
me around forever!

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.530
It's much nicer
now that she hates me.

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:21.630
Ranma! Heard
Shampoo dumped you.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.130
The breakup's not official yet.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:30.270
Ranma, you've always
treated Shampoo like dirt.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.440
I knew she'd
get wise someday.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.780
I guess she finally
got disgusted with you.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:41.620
Excuse me? We weren't datin'
so I can't get dumped!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:44.120
Besides, who cares
if she hates me?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.880
Jeez...

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:57.000
You Fool!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.560
Yeah, right.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.570
Ranma seems somewhat disturbed.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.480
Welcome to...

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:13.680
Yo, Shampoo.

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.320
C'mon, Shampoo...

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.120
I hard working now.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.890
What're you mad at?

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:21.980
I not mad.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.120
Then what's with the attitude...?

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.690
What you do?
Ranma go too far!

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:32.260
What's all the fuss?

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:35.130
Son-in-law!

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.350
W-Why's she givin'
me that icy stare...

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.450
So cold...
So unbelievably cold!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:55.920
Ever since childhood I've
been rejected by Shampoo!

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:59.430
I am the Earth's expert
on her frosty gaze!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:04.660
And her loathing of Ranma is a
100 times... No, 120 times worse!

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:08.470
Th-that can't be! She hates
me worse than Mousse!?

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:15.040
That brooch is the secret Reversal
Jewel of our Amazon tribe!

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:18.120
This untrustworthy jewel can
manipulate people's feelings!

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:21.190
When worn right-side up,
it enhances feelings of love.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:26.120
But when it's worn upside-down,
it turns love into bitter hatred!

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:29.520
What is the meaning
of this, Shampoo?

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:34.890
I can't figure you out!
Tell me the reason behind this!

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.900
Ranma no leave, then
Shampoo have to leave!

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.110
That's cold!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.200
Hey, wait!
Shampoo!

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:52.020
The terrifying
Reversal Jewel!

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:55.680
And yet, this could be
a blessing in disguise.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.650
When chased, one runs. When one
runs, the other must pursue.

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.820
The pathetic
human condition!

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:06.360
Perhaps my future son-in-law
has gotten interested!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.510
When Ranma stop
chasing Shampoo!?

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.910
When you tell me
what's goin' on!

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:21.370
Then Shampoo
have no choice.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.680
Never show your
face to Shampoo again!

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.550
Understand, you...

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:31.890
SCUM OF THE EARTH!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.870
That was a good one.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:50.570
But remember this,
Shampoo!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:55.010
Even if I gotta force you, I'll
make you say, one more time...

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:57.380
...THAT YOU LOVE ME!!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:05.350
Oh my.
Was that a battle cry?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.200
Shampoo!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.670
Ranma...!?

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:28.210
You come to see
Shampoo? I so happy!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.150
Oh-no!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.750
So you're in a
better mood now?

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:36.340
What you talking about, Ranma?

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.950
Well, for no reason,
you suddenly hated me...

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.490
That right!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:44.220
You LECHER!!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.160
WHY!?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:55.810
What did you do to Shampoo,
you dried-up monkey!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.770
Who's dried-up!?

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.940
What?
The Reversal Jewel!?

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:06.950
Surely you've heard
rumors of its usefulness!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.280
Then Shampoo's cold feelings
toward me, will suddenly...

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:12.980
Now's my chance!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.580
Shampoo! I love you!

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:24.970
So she doesn't hate you
as much as I thought.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:29.470
You WILL keep the secret of
the Reversal Jewel, Mousse.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:34.140
It won't do to have my
son-in-law find out about it now.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.750
"Saotome School of
Feminine Conquest, Step 1.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:44.690
When she's cold, make her
laugh, and she'll warm up."

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.190
Yo, Shampoo!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:53.790
I came up with this cute tale
that might make you smile.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.130
There was once this
very pretty dog, and...

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.200
It had cute tail.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.470
If Ranma want to
make smile for Shampoo...

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.700
Get lost!

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:09.570
"Feminine Conquest, Step 2.
If you can't push, pull.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:13.620
You must try to make
her a little jealous."

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.950
Hey, Akane!

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:20.620
Ranma, why are we
going to the Cat Cafe?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.790
Never mind that!

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.490
Yo, Shampoo!

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:32.190
Darn! No good.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.500
Why, you...

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.900
Just what do
you take me for!?

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:40.840
Hold it, Akane! You're
not supposed to get jealous...

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.350
Who's jealous!?
Who is!?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.980
"Step 3. Play upon
her maternal instincts.

00:10:52.090 --> 00:10:56.150
Show her your vulnerable side.
Get her pity and she'll be yours."

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.430
Shamp...

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.700
You blocking traffic.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.470
Here. All better.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.270
Ranma, you've been
pursuing Shampoo.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.370
What's the meaning of this?

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:17.910
Lemme alone, Mr. Tendo.
This is about a guy's pride!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:20.210
Ranma...

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.710
You got it all wrong.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:28.820
The only reason Shampoo fell for
you was that stupid Amazon law.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.760
T-That's right!

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.430
That's the way...

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.520
I can do it!

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:42.930
Again, you come!?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:49.570
Amazon law says that you have
to marry the man who bests you.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.950
Let's fight, Shampoo!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.480
I hate man who know not
when to give up!

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:10.090
The game's up!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:14.170
Now, admit that
you love me, Shampoo!

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.840
All right.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.110
You do
whatever want, Ranma.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:25.610
B-But even if Ranma
take Shampoo's body...

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.120
I... Uh...

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:32.350
Ranma never
take Shampoo's heart!!

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.450
What in the world are
you talkin' about!?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:40.620
Ranma just tried to
force himself on Shampoo!!

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.590
I knew it.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.070
I always thought he would.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:48.500
I guess Ranma's pretty obsessed
with her. Right, Akane?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.770
Ranma Saotome, I understand
the depths of your emotions.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:58.010
Yet we are but high school
students. Keep your love pure!

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.580
Y-You got
this all wrong!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.720
Why is this happenin' to me!?

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.530
You seem troubled,
future son-in-law.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:14.330
It's you!

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:16.830
I can help, but...

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:19.000
Well?

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:32.610
What!? There's a way I can make
Shampoo say that she loves me!?

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.680
Tell me! Tell me now!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:40.220
But first, you need admit
your love for Shampoo.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:43.620
In other words,
by losing, you win!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.260
Can it really be that easy?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.370
Nekohanten
Cat Cafe

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.400
Shampoo! I have good news for you!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:03.050
Ranma come tell
Shampoo he love her!?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.510
Aren't you happy, Shampoo?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.140
Thought alone
make Shampoo sick!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.720
That's right. I forgot.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.500
Is true,
Great-grandmother!?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:24.190
After he declares his love, we'll
hold the wedding right here.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.630
Shampoo not know relationship
go this far when I not looking!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:33.370
Celebration
Ranma's Declaration of Love

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.040
Oh, no!
Curse you, Mousse!

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:50.890
I'm gonna watch
a soccer game...

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:51.990
Wish I could go.

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:54.830
I've searched
for you, Akane Tendo!

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:56.370
Mousse?

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:59.770
There's not a moment to waste!
You must hear me out!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.840
Rotten Principal of
Akane Tendo. Furinkan High School

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:04.100
What are you talking to?

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:07.300
Mystic powers of
the Reversal Jewel!?

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:08.500
None other!

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:13.980
Under its influence, Shampoo has
reversed her natural feelings!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:18.610
So that's it! And here's Ranma
running around without a clue.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.950
What a fool.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.250
What's this?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.890
"Ranma Saotome will confess
his love to Shampoo.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.230
Four o'clock this afternoon,
at Nekohanten, Cat Cafe."

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.910
"Confess his love"!?
What on Earth!?

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:39.570
Very bad! We must
hurry, Akane Tendo!

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.910
If it's like the
old woman said...

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:49.780
But what if I say that I love
her and she still ignores me...

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:53.050
I'd really look stupid then!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:57.890
Could it be... I'm not the
hunk that I think I am?

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:07.830
Ranma! What is the
meaning of that invitation!?

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:08.930
Ukyo...

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.830
How could you ignore
your real fiancee?

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:15.280
Ranma! You don't really
love Shampoo, do you?

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:16.980
Ukyo!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:20.840
Do you love me!?

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.750
It's really important!
Answer me honestly!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.390
R-Ranma...

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.620
Of course...

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.730
l-I couldn't help
but love you.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.170
How dare you force a girl...

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:45.070
Force a girl to say something
like that! You jerk!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.880
I'm so embarrassed!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.260
I'm a hunk!
I AM a hunk!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:15.800
You're on, Shampoo! I'll make
you say that you love me!

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.670
Misguided idiot!

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:25.180
That lout is toying
with Shampoo's feelings!

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.880
I must strike him down!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:28.480
Be my guest.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.960
Nothing personal.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:42.490
You troublemakers will have to sleep,
until this is played out.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.470
Formal Rentals

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.470
Weapons set and ready!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:51.510
Look at the gigolo.
This isn't a war.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:54.480
Love is always a battle.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:56.010
Ranma!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:57.110
Mr. Tendo...

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.310
I beg you!

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.680
Don't throw your life
away in a pointless battle!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:07.150
Don't worry, Mr. Tendo!
I'll win this! I'm off!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.020
Ranma!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:13.500
I fear Ranma doesn't know...

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.160
...what the heck he's doing.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.060
Is Ranma doing this for real?

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.160
Wait and see.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:24.710
"Confession of love."
Sounds like a TV movie.

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:32.820
Do you understand, Shampoo?
Until Ranma confesses his love...

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:36.350
You must neither
smile nor speak.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.850
I understand real good,
great-grandmother!

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.730
Very well. It's time.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.090
Everyone, get into
position as planned.

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:51.770
We all jump out and applaud
when he confesses, right?

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.530
The stage is set,
and the actors are ready.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:59.370
With this many witnesses,
he won't be able to back out.

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:02.610
Ranma! Hurry come
say you love!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:10.220
Just you wait, Shampoo!
You're gonna say you love me!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:12.480
Shampoo!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.850
I've come today with
an important message.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:16.990
Listen carefully.

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.990
I love you!

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:21.620
Really, Ranma?

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:23.630
It's true!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.570
Ranma, Shampoo!
Congratulations!

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:28.970
You're a couple now!

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.770
You all heard!?

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.740
And, now,
on with the ceremony!

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:35.970
Wait!

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:41.280
Ranma, you mustn't! This is all
Shampoo and Cologne's trap!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.150
Too bad, Akane!

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.550
Now Shampoo have Ranma!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.680
Wo ai ni!

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:52.190
B-But that's
not fair! I...

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:55.970
I l-Io...
Ranma, I love...!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.760
Where am I?
Mousse?

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.770
That's right! Shampoo's
great-grandmother!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.710
I'm not going!

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:14.210
Why should I have to worry
about him all the time!?

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:16.790
I don't care
what he does.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.280
I'm here!

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:22.020
Yo, Shampoo!

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:25.230
I came to tell you
somethin' really important!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.700
Ranma! Finally you
come say you love me!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.600
I love you!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.190
Let's get married,
Shampoo!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.900
Ranma! I always
waiting so long to hear!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.000
Wo ai ni!

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:39.100
I'm sorry it took
so long, Shampoo.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.040
I love you!

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:42.310
I so happy!

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.310
Congratulations!

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.950
Ranma, I make you very special feast!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.250
Will you eat cooking?

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.490
Of course!

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:57.790
Is Shampoo's very best cooking!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.700
Chinese-style steamed duck!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.180
I told you, I'm not going!

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:15.710
I'm not going to make a fool
of myself for that jerk!

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.460
Okay! I'm only
gonna say this once.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:34.090
Listen close!

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:37.230
I...

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:40.090
I lo-Iov...

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:43.070
I love you, Shampoo!

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.540
You said it, Ranma.

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:46.300
I heard that, Ranma!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:47.540
With these two ears.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:49.640
Ryoga and Kuno...!

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:51.440
Ranma!

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.480
Akane!

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:54.980
I'm too late...

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:58.890
Akane! Ranma has confessed
his love to Shampoo!

00:21:58.990 --> 00:22:02.980
Ranma! You can no longer
call yourself Akane's fiance!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.900
Ranma have Shampoo now!

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:07.960
Ranma!

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:10.800
You just leave Akane to us!

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:12.960
Live in happiness with Shampoo.

00:22:14.170 --> 00:22:16.800
Akane, wait!
WAIT!

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:19.600
I really l-Iov...

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.510
Why in the world did I suddenly
start thinkin' about Akane!?

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:27.940
How long has it been?

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:29.610
57 minutes.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:31.480
My back is starting to hurt...

00:22:31.590 --> 00:22:32.580
Any moment now.

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:41.630
This is it!
This is a battle!

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:44.900
At this rate, I'll lose
before I even begin to fight!

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.300
I just gotta say it!

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:48.570
Shampoo! I... I...

00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:51.910
I l-Iov...

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:53.640
I love you, Ranma!

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:56.270
Love you lots!

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.510
I can't believe it! Akane just
confessed her love for Ranma!

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:03.110
That's good enough.

00:23:03.220 --> 00:23:04.310
Yeah, let's eat!

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:06.220
But how...?

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:10.620
You're all here to celebrate
with us? I'm so happy!

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:13.220
The Reversal Jewel!

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:16.490
And it's right-side up
where it promotes love!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:21.660
Now Akane's jealousy has turned
to pure, unconditional love!

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:24.540
Umm, what's goin' on?

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:26.200
Ranma, never forget...

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:30.800
...that I love you more than
anyone else in the world.

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:32.350
R-Really!?

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:37.440
No! Not Akane! Shampoo
much, MUCH more love Ranma!

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:42.720
Oh no! Ranma supposed
to tell he love first!

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:48.790
Ranma, you're irresistible! Even
Shampoo couldn't withstand you!

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:49.660
You're wonderful!

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:50.430
Really?

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:54.870
Of course! You're the man
I've given my heart to!

00:23:54.970 --> 00:23:56.030
You must trust in yourself!

00:23:57.710 --> 00:24:00.940
Now that you mention it, maybe
I've been a bit too single-minded.

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:03.710
Love isn't some
kind of battle...

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:05.010
I think that's enough.

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:10.150
Who could have guessed you
were really so cute after all...

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:13.160
Snap out of
your dream world!!

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:15.450
You brainless IDIOT!

00:24:20.330 --> 00:24:21.700
Whoa! Nice control!

00:24:21.800 --> 00:24:22.790
Marvelous!

00:24:23.740 --> 00:24:24.700
Wh-Why...

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:26.330
What perfect timing.

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:28.800
You're very well dressed, Ranma.

00:24:29.140 --> 00:24:31.010
Akane Tendo
and Shampoo.

00:24:31.110 --> 00:24:34.340
I find it hard to forgive
a two-timer, Ranma Saotome!

00:24:34.450 --> 00:24:36.910
You've been playing
with Akane's affections!

00:24:37.020 --> 00:24:39.810
And that's a crime
you'll pay for, Ranma!

00:24:39.920 --> 00:24:44.620
W-Wait a minute! I don't
know what you're talkin' about!

00:24:46.500 --> 00:24:49.500
No Visitors

00:24:58.300 --> 00:25:02.360
Ranma should have just told
Shampoo that he love her.

00:25:02.470 --> 00:25:05.970
Are you still angry? Do
you want the Reversal Jewel?

00:25:06.080 --> 00:25:06.980
No!

00:25:07.080 --> 00:25:10.880
I want Ranma to tell
me how he got injured!

00:25:10.980 --> 00:25:11.850
Ranma!

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:12.970
We're here to cheer you up!

00:25:13.250 --> 00:25:14.720
You sure got the girls, Ranma.

00:25:14.820 --> 00:25:16.810
I'd sure like to trade places.

00:25:16.920 --> 00:25:20.120
It's like he's surrounded by flowers!

00:25:20.220 --> 00:25:22.090
Ranma's gotta be happy!

00:25:22.190 --> 00:25:24.720
You misguided fool, Ranma!

00:25:26.160 --> 00:25:31.760
Nok haffy!
Nok haffy ak all!
